{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the equals sign (=)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/fdc3df66125d3b56a8c3a99705ddd09e.poster.avif?t=1757240133\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/fdc3df66125d3b56a8c3a99705ddd09e.webm?t=1757240133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/fdc3df66125d3b56a8c3a99705ddd09e.mp4?t=1757240133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E9uations is an innovative puzzle game that combines Sokoban with arithmetic rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push numbers and symbols to create equations, and when you connect the equals sign, calculations are automatically executed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to create the required numbers to destroy number blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/b89b1f2e25d3074fd6bda892ce42e5f4.poster.avif?t=1757240133\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/b89b1f2e25d3074fd6bda892ce42e5f4.webm?t=1757240133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/b89b1f2e25d3074fd6bda892ce42e5f4.mp4?t=1757240133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combination of Sokoban and arithmetic mechanics. This is an idea-based puzzle, not just simple math problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undo and restart. You can also undo restarts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable even if you're not good at math. Only uses basic arithmetic and simple calculations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main chapters with 7 unique themes plus challenging appendix chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 120 meticulously designed puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm felt craft art style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345810?t=1757240133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345810?t=1757240133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/e599b6f10a210f9d60b83831894ec25e0355c872/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757240133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/e599b6f10a210f9d60b83831894ec25e0355c872/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757240133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3849500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the equals sign (=)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/fdc3df66125d3b56a8c3a99705ddd09e.poster.avif?t=1757240133\" width=766 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345810/extras/fdc3df66125d3b56a8c3a99705ddd09e.webm?t=1757240133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams